  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend a use of your Channel Divinity to take on a shadowy form that grants you the following benefits for 1 minute. The form ends early if you dismiss it (no action required), have the Incapacitated condition, or deal Radiant damage with a spell.</p><p><strong>Shadow Stealth.</strong> While in Dim Light or Darkness, you can take the Hide action as a Bonus Action.</p><p><strong>Void Empowerment.</strong> When you cast a spell with a spell slot that deals Psychic or Necrotic damage, you can add 1d6 to one damage roll of the spell.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
